{title: He Darvayta}
{artist: Naal Ankita Aanand Joshi Advait Nemlekar}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m] [A#m],        He Darvayta
[G#m] [D#m],        Mayena Ivulushya Chimb Nhahata
[D#m] [A#m],        He Paghalata
[G#m] [D#m],        Ub Milta jara Vaahu Lagata
[B] [F#],        Halava... Naat he Baai va
[B] [C#] [F#],        Avakhal, Panyasarakha,
[B],        Vaahata...
[D#m] [C#] [B],        Ya Jiva He Lala Laavata,
[C#] [G#],        Karata, phool katyacha
[D#m] [A#m],        He Darvayta...
[D#m] [C#] [B],        Tipi Tipi Un saara pit he naata
[C#],        Deta Gaarva
[D#m] [C#] [B],        Kadu Kadu shosuniya ghet he naata
[C#],        deta Godva
[F#] [D#m],        Kadhi Kadhi bhandata
[B] [D#m],        Galbalata
[F#] [D#m],        Tutata nhaai va
[B] [C#],        tutata?
